WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.350
- [Homie] How can you decide what to do

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.270
when you're good at a lot of stuff?

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.103
- You pick one.

00:00:05.103 --> 00:00:06.670
- [Homie] So you don't waste your time.

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:07.503
- You pick one.

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:08.770
- [Homie] Well how do you
know which is the right one?

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:09.724
- You don't.

00:00:09.724 --> 00:00:10.557
(laughter)

00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:12.807
(clicking)

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.430
- How do you deal with the unknown?

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.080
- By recognizing I have no choice.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.270
I think it comes down to perfection

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.220
and like trying to make
the right, perfect call

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.539
and I think that the right, perfect call

00:00:27.539 --> 00:00:30.660
about nine out of 10
times is the fastest call.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.530
So I tend to not overthink at all.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.410
I'm very intuitive and most
of my business mistakes

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.590
have been to act too quickly
and then have to bail out.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.560
I've found that speed trumps everything.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.840
Too many people are
crippled by the right hire,

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.460
by the right meeting, I say,

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.770
work harder, work more efficient,

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:49.650
make more 15 and 30 minute meetings

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.972
that leave you more time to do more things

00:00:50.972 --> 00:00:54.260
and create more opportunities
and don't be crippled

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.153
by choosing the right
opportunities or not.

00:00:56.153 --> 00:00:59.403
(hip hop instrumental)

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.490
I believe one of the most
fascinating excuses in life

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:07.590
is that I'm so good at so many things

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:08.920
that I don't know which one to pick.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.946
So many of you are not taking action

00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:14.980
'cause you overthink it, you
overthink it, you overthink it.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:17.170
I think the thing that bothers me is that

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:19.946
people are crippled by their options

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.770
and then actually aren't
doing anything in parallel.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.747
They're lolly gagging while they decide.

00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:26.930
If you're so good at so many things,

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.210
you'll pick one, you'll be good at that

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:29.080
and then you can do a bunch of things.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.550
I'm doing a bunch of things.

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.130
You need to be doing,
you need to be executing.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.089
So if there's three to four

00:01:34.089 --> 00:01:36.250
tangible things going on in your mind,

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.704
you need to make sure your
internships, your free time,

00:01:38.704 --> 00:01:43.500
and whatever you can do
to let you taste them

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.730
and get context around them
is what really matters.

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.451
I always say deploy your resources

00:01:47.451 --> 00:01:49.370
that you can afford to lose.

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.760
A lot of you don't have the dollars.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:51.680
I used to not have the dollars,

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.234
but I had my time.

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:57.149
Taking action is, especially
if it doesn't cost you

00:01:57.149 --> 00:01:59.447
top money and it's just time,

00:01:59.447 --> 00:02:02.891
is always a better answer
than pondering or thinking

00:02:02.891 --> 00:02:05.516
or trying to decide if
this is going to work.

00:02:05.516 --> 00:02:08.030
You don't know and one
of the smartest things

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:09.532
I do as an entrepreneur
and business person,

00:02:09.532 --> 00:02:11.560
is I do things so I can understand

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.514
whether they work or not.

